WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.633
A public restroom can look different from place to place. These steps are one option.

2
00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:10.538
Look for a restroom sign, or ask staff where to go. You can take a moment.

3
00:00:10.538 --> 00:00:15.773
Wait for a free cubicle. Choose an accessible one if that works better for you.

4
00:00:15.773 --> 00:00:20.413
Use the restroom and take the time you need. There is no need to rush.

5
00:00:20.413 --> 00:00:23.461
Wash and dry your hands when you are finished.

6
00:00:23.461 --> 00:00:28.498
Return to your group or the place you came from. You can ask for directions.

7
00:00:28.498 --> 00:00:35.300
If you need support, ask a trusted person or staff member. Your privacy matters.
